---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="해인교회 - 인천 계양구">
  <main>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-sub">인천 계양구 계산동</p>
        <h1>해인교회에<br />오신 것을 환영합니다</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">하나님의 사랑으로 지역사회를 섬기며 함께 성장하는 교회입니다.</p>
        <div class="hero-btns">
          <a href="/about" class="btn-primary">교회 소개</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary">오시는 길</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 예배 안내 -->
    <section class="services">
      <h2>예배 안내</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🙏</div>
          <h3>주일예배</h3>
          <p>매주 일요일<br /><strong>오전 11:00</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">📖</div>
          <h3>수요예배</h3>
          <p>매주 수요일<br /><strong>오후 7:30</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🌅</div>
          <h3>새벽기도</h3>
          <p>월~금요일<br /><strong>오전 5:30</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</div>
          <h3>사랑방모임</h3>
          <p>매주 금요일<br /><strong>오후 7:00</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 주일설교 + 주보 -->
    <section class="recent">
      <div class="recent-grid">
        <div class="recent-box">
          <h2>주일설교</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.08.02</span>
              <span class="title">8월 2일 31과</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.19</span>
              <span class="title">29과 여호와를 찬양하라!</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.12</span>
              <span class="title">28과 바른 길을 보여주소셔!</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.05</span>
              <span class="title">27과. 통곡을 기쁨으로</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/sermons" class="more-link">더보기 →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="recent-box">
          <h2>주보</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.08.02</span>
              <span class="title">20260802 주보</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.26</span>
              <span class="title">20260726 주보</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.19</span>
              <span class="title">20260719 주보</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date">2026.07.12</span>
              <span class="title">20260712 주보</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/news" class="more-link">더보기 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 말씀 -->
    <section class="verse">
      <blockquote>
        "서로 사랑하라 내가 너희를 사랑한 것 같이 너희도 서로 사랑하라"
      </blockquote>
      <cite>— 요한복음 13:34</cite>
    </section>

    <!-- 사회복지선교사역 -->
    <section class="mission-preview">
      <h2>사회복지선교사역</h2>
      <p class="mission-desc">해인교회는 지역사회의 어려운 이웃을 위해 꾸준히 섬기고 있습니다.</p>
      <div class="mission-grid">
        <div class="mission-card">
          <h3>인천내일을여는집</h3>
          <p>노숙인 쉼터 운영 및 지원사업</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-card">
          <h3>몰래산타 이웃사랑</h3>
          <p>14년째 이어오는 성탄 나눔 행사</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-card">
          <h3>쪽방촌 이웃 지원</h3>
          <p>인천 지역 소외계층 후원 및 돌봄</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/mission" class="more-link center">선교사역 더보기 →</a>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a4fa0 0%, #0d2d6b 100%);
    color: #fff; padding: 6rem 2rem; text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; opacity: 0.75; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .hero-desc { font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.85; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: #fff; color: #1a4fa0; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 50px; transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
  .btn-secondary {
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7); color: #fff;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem; border-radius: 50px; transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

  /* Services */
  .services { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: #f7f9ff; text-align: center; }
  .services h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #1a2a4a; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .card-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .card {
    background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  }
  .card-icon { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #1a4fa0; }
  .card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* Recent */
  .recent { padding: 5rem 2rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .recent-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; }
  .recent-box h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #1a2a4a; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a4fa0; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .recent-box ul { list-style: none; }
  .recent-box li { display: flex; gap: 1rem; padding: 0.7rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; align-items: center; }
  .date { color: #888; font-size: 0.8rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .title { color: #333; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .more-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; color: #1a4fa0; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .more-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .more-link.center { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; }

  /* Verse */
  .verse { background: #1a4fa0; color: #fff; padding: 4rem 2rem; text-align: center; }
  blockquote { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 1rem; }
  cite { font-size: 1rem; opacity: 0.7; }

  /* Mission */
  .mission-preview { padding: 5rem 2rem; background: #f7f9ff; text-align: center; }
  .mission-preview h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #1a2a4a; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .mission-desc { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .mission-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .mission-card {
    background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 4px solid #1a4fa0; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  }
  .mission-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; color: #1a4fa0; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .mission-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
